# Agent Definitions Directory

This directory contains declarative agent definitions in .md format.

## Existing Agents

- `asura_spawner.md` - Task decomposition and agent orchestration
- `asura_despawner.md` - Systemic cleanup and task termination
- `bug_hunter.md` - Bug detection and surgical fixing
- `explorer.md` - Codebase navigation and discovery expert
- `interactive_agent.md` - Sovereign tactical interface for OS operations
- `reviewer.md` - Security and quality audit specialist
- `simplifier.md` - Code refactoring and logic advisor
- `validator.md` - System verification and test specialist

Each agent is self-contained with its own role definition, capabilities, and focus areas. New agents can be added following the same markdown + YAML frontmatter pattern.
